Z||000005||Reality||11-24-2001||04:17 PM||||Picture looks great! Now if you want or don't want it nitpicked don't read any further. My only comment on the image itself is that with the light source coming from the UR close to HL your cast shadow of the car should extend down into the LL corner of the picture. The shadow that is on the car is kind of awkward as well, it cuts back into the underside of the car instead of dropping down and being a representation of vehicle. Only other thing is that the size of the car compared to the size of the road seems a bit off. Okay just thought that since it was for some class that it might help.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/realitysignature_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
